Release date: August 18th, 2017

==Beta 0.1.4.3 Patch Notes==

<br>
'''BUG FIXES'''
* In [[Beta 0.1.4.1]] a bug was introduced that would cause some ships, upon touching the terrain even briefly, to suddenly be considered deteriorating and sunken. This has been fixed.
* Atlas cores built before the release of [[Beta 0.1.4.1]] now will gain the atlas pulse functionality. Ships frames built before [[Beta 0.1.4.1]] now can be affected by an atlas pulse.
* Resolved an issue where some players were unable to verify their Worlds Adrift accounts and were therefore unable to log into the game.

